	(text_box "Pmod sockets (hand soldered), 0.9 inch apart on the board edge so a double-width module spans both: 33 Ω series, Pmod pins 1-4 = IO0-3, 7-10 = IO4-7, 5/11 ground, 6/12 3.3 V (pads 1,3,5,7 / 2,4,6,8 / 9,10 / 11,12 in KiCad's odd/even numbering). Both buses are drawn; the labels on the\nsocket end are the same bus members."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 599.44 547.37 0)
