		(uuid "117fe943-fd09-51df-f146-3fdb98fd5cfe")
	)
	(text_box "10 MHz sine from a GPSDO, or any 0.5 to 3.3 V square wave up to 100 MHz. 50 Ω if the shunt is in. AC coupled into an unbuffered inverter biased at its own threshold by the 1 MΩ, then a Schmitt buffer: the GPSDO board's front end. The FPGA's PLL\nlocks to it (8 MHz minimum)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 187.96 0)
		(size 175.26 6.35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
