			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a50cbbc8-4665-9338-aadc-8cbf677aa9c8")
	)
	(text_box "One box per I/O bank, in the position the bank has on the package: 7 and 6 on the west (ADC above, DAC below), 0 and 1 on the north (clocks, I2C, LEDs, buttons; the SDRAM), 2 and 3 on the east (Ethernet and HDMI; SD card, USB, serial, Pmods), 8 on the south (the sysCONFIG pins: SPI flash, JTAG, slow controls). Every ball is named by its ball number; a PCLK is a primary clock input. The pin plan is generated (gen/fpga.py) and the same table writes the .lpf and the LiteX platform file."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(size 420.37 5.08)
